page.append('<figure><img loading="lazy" src="../previews/hollow-creek/fitted-site-native-fitout.png" alt="Current whole site"><figcaption>Current native scene overview · Canonical van/terrain/placement preserved</figcaption></figure><h2>Actual floor component inspection</h2><p>These isolated copies show the actual shaded floor and a gold mesh-edge diagnostic beside it. Gold lines are inspection graphics, not the in-game material. No floor is replaced with a flat pad.</p>')
